# a server that has been "temporarily" open since 2016
Port 22
Protocol 2,1
PermitRootLogin yes
PasswordAuthentication yes
PermitEmptyPasswords no
X11Forwarding yes
MaxAuthTries 10
LogLevel QUIET
Ciphers aes128-ctr,aes256-cbc,3des-cbc
MACs hmac-sha2-256,hmac-md5
PermitUserEnvironment yes
GatewayPorts yes
UsePAM yes
Subsystem sftp /usr/lib/openssh/sftp-server
